==English==

===Noun===
'''chickenpox''' ('''chicken pox''')
{{wikipedia}}

# {{pathology}} A common [[childhood]] [[disease]] caused by the varicella-zoster [[virus]] (VZV), also known as human herpes virus 3 (HHV-3).

